1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,770
If multiplying adds angles, then raising to the n th power multiplies the angle by n.

2
00:00:06,770 --> 00:00:17,200
That is De Moivre's theorem: cos theta plus i sin theta, to the n, equals cos n theta plus i sin n theta.

3
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:20,533
With a modulus, r becomes r to the n.

